.145, "text": "A fungal infection in the mouth."}, {"start": 36.766, "end": 38.587, "text": "And it is one that needs treating."}, {"start": 39.347, "end": 40.627, "text": "What does the treatment involve?"}, {"start": 41.488, "end": 43.048, "text": "Sporanox."}, {"start": 43.108, "end": 45.509, "text": "100 milligrams daily for two weeks."}, {"start": 46.19, "end": 47.59, "text": "You take it after a meal."}, {"start": 48.431, "end": 50.652, "text": "After a meal every day for two weeks."}, {"start": 51.492, "end": 52.292, "text": "Exactly right."}, {"start": 52.953, "end": 54.093, "text": "Always after food."}, {"start": 54.833, "end": 55.194, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 55.334, "end": 55.874, "text": "That is clear."}, {"start": 56.762, "end": 57.863, "text": "Any questions about it?"}, {"start": 58.624, "end": 59.865, "text": "No, I do not think so."}, {"start": 60.706, "end": 60.967, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 62.088, "end": 63.93, "text": "Have you been baking anything new lately?"}, {"start": 64.77, "end": 66.392, "text": "I tried a rye loaf at the weekend."}, {"start": 66.773, "end": 68.294, "text": "It turned out better than I expected."}, {"start": 69.235, "end": 70.336, "text": "That is a fine result."}, {"start": 71.157, "end": 72.078, "text": "Take care, Suzanne."}, {"start": 72.719, "end": 73.199, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 73.399, "end": 73.8, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.508}}